# Trivy baseline: CVEs with NO upstream fix yet, inherited from the
# python:3.12-slim (Debian 13) base image. I consciously accept these so the
# gate fails on ACTIONABLE findings only. The CISA KEV gate (scripts/kev-gate.py)
# still fails the build if any of these is ever added to the actively-exploited
# catalog. Revisit on every base-image upgrade.

# ncurses: buffer overflow in form library — no fix available in Debian 13
CVE-2025-69720

# systemd-homed: local privilege escalation — no fix available yet
CVE-2026-16742

# acl: symlink traversal privilege escalation — no fix available yet
CVE-2026-54369

# util-linux: mount/nsenter/bind-mount hardening (4 CVEs) — no fixes available yet
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410

# perl Archive-Tar: DoS via crafted tar header — no fix available yet
CVE-2026-9538